SUMMARY:The Rocky Horror Picture Show (1975) [Open Caption Screening]
LOCATION:Shannon Hall\, Memorial Union
DESCRIPTION:USA | 100 min | R | Dir. Jim Sharman\n"A rain-soaked couple ta
 ke refuge in the castle of a transvestite mad scientist from outer space 
 who is about to unveil his greatest creation." -IMDB\n"One hundred minute
 s of pure queer celebration that manages to concoct a bizarre cocktail of
  sincerity and reckless abandon." \n-Andy Twedle via Rotten Tomatoes \n
  \nWatch the trailer here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4plqh6obZW4 
 \n\nDoors Open @ 8:00 PM\, Pre-Show begins @ 8:30 PM\, Film Starts @ 9:00
  PM!\n \nProps & Costumes Guidelines:\nAudience participation is more th
 an welcome\, costumes & character cosplay are encouraged\, and this event
  features a live shadow cast with Madison's own and beloved Velvet Darkne
 ss. \n\nHowever\, for the sake of the cast and crew the following items 
 will NOT be allowed in the theater:  rice\, toast\, hot dogs\, squirt gu
 ns\, lighters or open flames\, food/drink of any kind\, or glitter/small 
 metallic confetti.\nThe following props ARE allowed:  playing cards\, to
 ilet paper\, party hats\, noisemakers\, newspapers\, and flashlights.  V
 elvet Darkness will have prop bags with approved items available for purc
 hase at a nominal cost on the night of the event.\n \nCultural Context:\
 nInterested in the history of this event? Check out this article: https:
 //outwritenewsmag.org/2018/03/the-camp-and-cult-of-the-rocky-horror-pictu
 re-show/ \n \nFor information on available assistive content for WUD Fi
 lm screenings\, please visit the Assistive Movie Screenings in the Marque
 e Theater page.  \n\nVisit our Informed Moviegoing Resources page for l
 inks to resources that explore film ratings and content alerts.\n\nThis e
 vent is intended for UW-Madison students\, faculty\, staff\, Wisconsin Un
 ion members and their guests. Anyone can become a Wisconsin Union member.
 \n\nhttps://union.wisc.edu/events-and-activities/event-calendar/event/wud
 -film-presents-rocky-horror-picture-show-1975-open-0\n\nSource: WUD Film 
 (The Marquee)
URL:https://union.wisc.edu/events-and-activities/event-calendar/event/wud-
 film-presents-rocky-horror-picture-show-1975-open-0
END:VEVENT
